%% Same node/edge contract as decision-flow.svg.
flowchart TD
    INPUT["Input contract and selected guide<br/>Verify source shape, versions, units, references and frequency<br/>Preserve original source records and meaningful context"]
    FHIR["Actual FHIR resources supplied?<br/>Yes: local Matchbox/HL7 or MII full guide validation<br/>No: CSV/DB set checks; no synthetic patient resources<br/>Retain formal issues separately; missing coverage is incomplete"]
    LOOKUP["Look up declared code and unit systems<br/>Configured primary APIs, actual local catalogues and labels<br/>Retain editions and sources; supplements enrich names<br/>Verified / invalid / unknown are distinct outcomes"]
    FIT["Assess the whole semantic set<br/>Name, LOINC axes, unit dimension and specimen/method fit<br/>UCUM validity alone does not prove analyte compatibility<br/>Known example units support proposals, not universal limits"]
    CONVERT["Supported transformation<br/>Verified target unit and linear factor<br/>Transform value and each bound independently<br/>A sourced spelling is still a review proposal"]
    UNKNOWN["Ambiguous or unsupported<br/>Missing denominator or evidence<br/>Retain error / unresolved finding<br/>No guessed correction or factor"]
    UNCHANGED["Documented unchanged fit<br/>Keep supplied code/unit/value<br/>Clinical applicability remains a review task<br/>Continue numeric/reference checks"]
    NUMERIC["Check values and full reference sets<br/>Finite numbers, ordered bounds and independently valid units<br/>Out-of-reference is descriptive; preserve qualifiers<br/>Evidence of reported practice requires contextual review"]
    REPORT["Write checks, recommendations and sources<br/>Optional Ollama research: real search, then bounded extraction<br/>Codes, names, units, intervals and their sources<br/>Formal FHIR state, credibility and readiness remain separate"]
    REVIEW["Clinician adjudication and scoped reuse<br/>Record reviewer, time, evidence and explicit mapping decision<br/>Recheck approved targets/factors and every bound on reuse<br/>Apply approved mappings in ETL and validate actual FHIR"]
    INPUT --> FHIR
    FHIR --> LOOKUP
    LOOKUP --> FIT
    FIT --> CONVERT
    FIT --> UNKNOWN
    FIT --> UNCHANGED
    CONVERT --> NUMERIC
    UNKNOWN --> NUMERIC
    UNCHANGED --> NUMERIC
    NUMERIC --> REPORT
    REPORT --> REVIEW
    classDef normal fill:#ffffff,stroke:#b7cec9,color:#142d42
    classDef teal fill:#eef7f4,stroke:#b7cec9,color:#142d42
    class REPORT,REVIEW teal
